  "body": "Fixes #7791\n\n## What\n\nSyncs the dogfood `.opencode/plugin/mcpx` copy to its source of truth, `pkgs/mcpx/plugin/opencode/mcpx` — a pure copy of the three drifted paths, no other changes:\n\n- `.opencode/plugin/mcpx/daemon.ts` — was the pre-#3490 `goDurationMs` (no Greek-mu U+03BC unit, Go dot-fractions `.5s`/`1.s` rejected, saturation cap `.776` instead of `.775`); now the #3490 version from `04f564f211`.\n- `.opencode/plugin/mcpx/daemon.test.ts` — now carries the #3490 Go-parity test block.\n- `.opencode/plugin/mcpx/biome.json` — added (present in the pkgs copy since the #5151 pinned plugin lint/type-check work, `6e50a61760`); was missing.\n\nNo change under `pkgs/**`: the pkgs tree is the source of truth.\n\n## Verification (laptop worktree, branch based on origin/main `e2891d45f0`)\n\n- Pre-fix (both at `d222177982` and re-verified at `e2891d45f0`): the mcpx.yml sync guard fails —\n  `diff -r pkgs/mcpx/plugin/opencode/mcpx .opencode/plugin/mcpx` → rc=1, exactly the three paths above; `mcpx-session.ts` in sync.\n- Post-fix: `diff -r …` clean; `diff pkgs/mcpx/plugin/opencode/mcpx-session.ts .opencode/plugin/mcpx-session.ts` clean.\n- `bun test` in `.opencode/plugin/mcpx`: 57 pass, 5 skip (real-daemon tests, skipped without a daemon), 0 fail.\n\n## Why it drifted\n\nThe only sync guard lives in `mcpx.yml`, which has no push/pull_request triggers and is `disabled_manually` — filed separately as a companion CI issue this run. This is the third drift instance (#314, #2795); the durable fix is the guard running again, not this sync alone.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796759198&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7793&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7793&signature=b70e09fcbabffe52d25a5b4d90230f976d0d447e5d22cff7484f1cc3f2a4330a\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7793?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
